</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000005L5013X_07" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AJV00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>This diagnostic trouble code is also output when there is no refrigerant in the cycle, so if the code is output, first check the refrigerant amount.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
