<testtitle>Inspect Cooler Piping</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Install the A/C tool.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Perform evacuation and check that the cooler piping can maintain a vacuum.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
